me":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","review_id":"CY9nz0GgN1OnqKoE4e0WvQ","date":"2012-11-07T22:10:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425035715103149,"text_excerpt":"One of the first places I hit up when I got to New Orleans. I love it! You can hang out on the patio for free. They don't make you buy stuff. Cafe Beignet is to the side, and you can order drinks/food if you like. The music is pretty good. Great place to sit down and relax for a bit. I came here twice while I was in town and liked the music both times."},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","review_id":"-itrsQhvaTKhV8HaIq6FsQ","date":"2015-01-21T05:54:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398894309997559,"text_excerpt":"Have a beignet while listening to live jazz music. Enjoy the statues of the great jazz musicians. The place is very calming and café-like. My favorite in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","review_id":"2fnnD0wdFcmxQldp1DHlUA","date":"2017-07-02T18:09:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9384163618087769,"text_excerpt":"When in New Orleans it's just a given that you visit Bourbon St. It's a mixed bag, mostly bizarre carnival (even on quiet days) that you just have to experience. Then move on to the rest of the French Quarter. Musical Legends Park is a really pleasant and unexpected treasure to stumble upon amidst the stereotype of Bourbon St. A charming little square draws you off the street and acts as an oasis. A jazz / blues trio was playing in the square that was well populated with folks enjoying the music, drinks, food and atmosphere. There is plenty of seating, some covered around the bar area where we posted up. A Cafe Beignet resides at the back end of the space to provide some nourishment - muf..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","photo_id":"teTmQXPAn13tkVs5pV36CA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/teTmQXPAn13tkVs5pV36CA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8920013308525085},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","photo_id":"jIQEZu9nMSDyOZzoI2VOkw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jIQEZu9nMSDyOZzoI2VOkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8882871270179749},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","photo_id":"BJujSNE4G1IGXBzp7wbR-A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BJujSNE4G1IGXBzp7wbR-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8232312202453613},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","photo_id":"HXMIeNij5jGJuAc1_odUAA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HXMIeNij5jGJuAc1_odUAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7568929195404053},{"business_id":"U1gebvkhLXW-m7dRqvZKwA","photo_id":"PyvNGtPgV94rKdAqIxUN6A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/PyvNGtPgV94rKdAqIxUN6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7329448461532593}]},"notebook_case":null}
